{"id": "wwdc2017-823", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2017/823", "wordCount": 1465, "segments": [{"start": 18.0, "text": "Let's talk about designing"}, {"start": 20.0, "text": "glyphs, and I think a good place"}, {"start": 22.0, "text": "to start is what is a glyph?"}, {"start": 24.0, "text": "A glyph, traditionally, is a"}, {"start": 26.0, "text": "topographical character, but it"}, {"start": 28.0, "text": "could also be a symbol or a"}, {"start": 32.0, "text": "simple shape of a real world"}, {"start": 33.0, "text": "object, or it can be a"}, {"start": 37.0, "text": "combination of shapes to"}, {"start": 39.0, "text": "represent function or a concept."}, {"start": 43.0, "text": "But you might be thinking what"}, {"start": 44.0, "text": "is the difference between this"}, {"start": 45.0, "text": "and an icon."}, {"start": 47.0, "text": "So, to help illustrate the"}, {"start": 48.0, "text": "difference, let's take a look at"}, {"start": 50.0, "text": "this example of four iPhone"}, {"start": 51.0, "text": "icons."}, {"start": 54.0, "text": "An icon can refer to a broad set"}, {"start": 56.0, "text": "of assets ranging from simple"}, {"start": 58.0, "text": "low fidelity shapes like you can"}, {"start": 59.0, "text": "see on the left to illustrative,"}, {"start": 62.0, "text": "colorful, and highly rendered"}, {"start": 65.0, "text": "assets that you can see on the"}, {"start": 67.0, "text": "right."}, {"start": 68.0, "text": "The two assets on the left can"}, {"start": 71.0, "text": "also be defined as glyphs, and"}, {"start": 73.0, "text": "that's because of their"}, {"start": 74.0, "text": "simplicity, and for the most"}, {"start": 76.0, "text": "part, glyphs are monochromatic"}, {"start": 78.0, "text": "and should be colorized"}, {"start": 79.0, "text": "programmatically."}, {"start": 83.0, "text": "This is the iOS wallet app icon,"}, {"start": 86.0, "text": "and you can see a nice use of"}, {"start": 87.0, "text": "color and some subtle shading."}, {"start": 91.0, "text": "And here's the app represented"}, {"start": 93.0, "text": "as a glyph."}, {"start": 94.0, "text": "So, you get the idea, but let's"}, {"start": 97.0, "text": "take a look at one more example."}, {"start": 100.0, "text": "This is the phone app icon, and"}, {"start": 103.0, "text": "if we take away that iconic"}, {"start": 104.0, "text": "shape and the color, you see"}, {"start": 108.0, "text": "where I'm going with this, we're"}, {"start": 109.0, "text": "left with this glyph."}, {"start": 110.0, "text": "So, in this case, the glyph is"}, {"start": 112.0, "text": "actually part of what makes up"}, {"start": 113.0, "text": "the icon."}, {"start": 116.0, "text": "Now, effective glyphs have some"}, {"start": 118.0, "text": "key characteristics."}, {"start": 120.0, "text": "They're highly simplified in"}, {"start": 122.0, "text": "form."}, {"start": 123.0, "text": "They're conceptually universal,"}, {"start": 127.0, "text": "and they're quickly readable in"}, {"start": 129.0, "text": "context as to their function or"}, {"start": 131.0, "text": "purpose."}, {"start": 135.0, "text": "Many of us have experienced"}, {"start": 136.0, "text": "being in a foreign place,"}, {"start": 138.0, "text": "somewhere where we don't, you"}, {"start": 139.0, "text": "know, relate to the culture or"}, {"start": 141.0, "text": "another language, and it can be"}, {"start": 143.0, "text": "quite a relief when we see a"}, {"start": 144.0, "text": "symbol that we recognize."}, {"start": 146.0, "text": "So, in this case, you don't have"}, {"start": 147.0, "text": "to know German to know the right"}, {"start": 151.0, "text": "way to the airport, and that's"}, {"start": 154.0, "text": "thanks to this simple universal"}, {"start": 156.0, "text": "shape, which in this context we"}, {"start": 158.0, "text": "understand to represent airport."}, {"start": 162.0, "text": "So, glyphs are a powerful"}, {"start": 164.0, "text": "communication tool, and that's"}, {"start": 165.0, "text": "why we make them part of our"}, {"start": 166.0, "text": "design language in UI."}, {"start": 172.0, "text": "So, let's go through a quick"}, {"start": 173.0, "text": "exercise to conceptualize an"}, {"start": 175.0, "text": "effective glyph."}, {"start": 177.0, "text": "Let's say we need one to"}, {"start": 178.0, "text": "represent delicious."}, {"start": 181.0, "text": "The first thing you might think"}, {"start": 182.0, "text": "of is a cheeseburger, and you"}, {"start": 186.0, "text": "would have no argument from me."}, {"start": 187.0, "text": "I do think cheeseburgers are"}, {"start": 189.0, "text": "delicious."}, {"start": 190.0, "text": "But believe it or not, some"}, {"start": 192.0, "text": "people do not like"}, {"start": 193.0, "text": "cheeseburgers."}, {"start": 194.0, "text": "So, what's better than a"}, {"start": 195.0, "text": "cheeseburger?"}, {"start": 197.0, "text": "Pizza? I see some people shaking"}, {"start": 200.0, "text": "their heads."}, {"start": 201.0, "text": "I don't know. Okay. I think I got one that we"}, {"start": 203.0, "text": "can all relate to."}, {"start": 205.0, "text": "How about ice cream?"}, {"start": 207.0, "text": "No. Well, all right, well, I"}, {"start": 209.0, "text": "think I could -- you got the"}, {"start": 210.0, "text": "idea here -- not everyone"}, {"start": 212.0, "text": "relates to these specific food"}, {"start": 214.0, "text": "items in the same way."}, {"start": 218.0, "text": "So, these aren't effective."}, {"start": 219.0, "text": "So, let's try something a little"}, {"start": 220.0, "text": "bit different, and what about"}, {"start": 222.0, "text": "something to get to the core of"}, {"start": 224.0, "text": "what delicious might make us"}, {"start": 225.0, "text": "feel."}, {"start": 228.0, "text": "Something like a facial"}, {"start": 229.0, "text": "expression."}, {"start": 230.0, "text": "It's cute and relatable,"}, {"start": 231.0, "text": "expressive, but we should be"}, {"start": 235.0, "text": "mindful here that in some"}, {"start": 236.0, "text": "cultures using like a face, a"}, {"start": 240.0, "text": "mouth, or a body part can be"}, {"start": 241.0, "text": "seen as inappropriate; so, be"}, {"start": 245.0, "text": "mindful of that."}, {"start": 246.0, "text": "So, what is a universal symbol"}, {"start": 249.0, "text": "for delicious?"}, {"start": 253.0, "text": "What about a heart?"}, {"start": 255.0, "text": "We love cheeseburgers."}, {"start": 256.0, "text": "Some people like pizza."}, {"start": 257.0, "text": "Some people love ice cream."}, {"start": 260.0, "text": "The association of love with"}, {"start": 262.0, "text": "delicious is much more universal"}, {"start": 263.0, "text": "than our other options."}, {"start": 266.0, "text": "So, this is a nice effective"}, {"start": 267.0, "text": "solution."}, {"start": 269.0, "text": "Okay. So, let's take a look at"}, {"start": 271.0, "text": "some examples of where we use"}, {"start": 273.0, "text": "glyphs on our platforms, on the"}, {"start": 277.0, "text": "Mac, in the menu bar, in tool"}, {"start": 283.0, "text": "bars, and in sidebars, and most"}, {"start": 288.0, "text": "recently, in the touch bar."}, {"start": 292.0, "text": "On iOS, in tab bars, list views,"}, {"start": 299.0, "text": "and home screen quick action"}, {"start": 301.0, "text": "menus. So, you can see, glyphs are"}, {"start": 303.0, "text": "everywhere, and also notice that"}, {"start": 305.0, "text": "they rarely ever stand alone."}, {"start": 308.0, "text": "So, that's why we need to be"}, {"start": 309.0, "text": "mindful of some design"}, {"start": 310.0, "text": "considerations when, you know,"}, {"start": 312.0, "text": "we're crafting a set of glyphs."}, {"start": 316.0, "text": "Our goal should be to make them"}, {"start": 318.0, "text": "feel like a family, and a family"}, {"start": 320.0, "text": "has a shared set of"}, {"start": 321.0, "text": "characteristics."}, {"start": 323.0, "text": "So, we're going to look at"}, {"start": 325.0, "text": "optical weight, lines, and"}, {"start": 330.0, "text": "positioning."}, {"start": 334.0, "text": "In this example, the set feels a"}, {"start": 337.0, "text": "bit right heavy."}, {"start": 339.0, "text": "The two glyphs on the left just"}, {"start": 343.0, "text": "are optically smaller, and"}, {"start": 344.0, "text": "consequently they feel a bit"}, {"start": 346.0, "text": "less significant. So, if we turn on our guides, we"}, {"start": 349.0, "text": "can see that we've constrained"}, {"start": 350.0, "text": "ourselves to these vertical"}, {"start": 351.0, "text": "bounds."}, {"start": 353.0, "text": "Let's turn those off and scale"}, {"start": 354.0, "text": "the up optically, and that feels"}, {"start": 358.0, "text": "much better."}, {"start": 360.0, "text": "Here's the before and the after."}, {"start": 365.0, "text": "Because the elliptical shape of"}, {"start": 367.0, "text": "messages and the narrow shape of"}, {"start": 369.0, "text": "phone have less surface area, we"}, {"start": 372.0, "text": "can use scale to achieve this"}, {"start": 373.0, "text": "optical balance."}, {"start": 376.0, "text": "And let's notice another subtle"}, {"start": 378.0, "text": "detail in the set here that"}, {"start": 379.0, "text": "helps the family of these"}, {"start": 380.0, "text": "glyphs."}, {"start": 382.0, "text": "Look at the gap in the video"}, {"start": 384.0, "text": "camera and the negative space in"}, {"start": 387.0, "text": "the envelope."}, {"start": 388.0, "text": "They share the same line weight."}, {"start": 389.0, "text": "So, let's look at lines next."}, {"start": 396.0, "text": "Here, it looks like the glyphs"}, {"start": 398.0, "text": "might have been scaled from"}, {"start": 399.0, "text": "various places to fit together"}, {"start": 401.0, "text": "at the size."}, {"start": 402.0, "text": "But because they don't share a"}, {"start": 404.0, "text": "consistent line weight, some"}, {"start": 406.0, "text": "look more emphasized than"}, {"start": 408.0, "text": "others, and this can be"}, {"start": 409.0, "text": "confusing, and they just don't"}, {"start": 412.0, "text": "family well."}, {"start": 414.0, "text": "So, when we normalize these,"}, {"start": 416.0, "text": "we've created a much more"}, {"start": 417.0, "text": "coherent set."}, {"start": 418.0, "text": "Here's the before and the after."}, {"start": 426.0, "text": "A subtle change like this can"}, {"start": 427.0, "text": "really affect the integrity of"}, {"start": 428.0, "text": "your app."}, {"start": 430.0, "text": "Let's move on to positioning."}, {"start": 433.0, "text": "And this is a great example here"}, {"start": 435.0, "text": "of optical positioning, which"}, {"start": 437.0, "text": "can sometimes be overlooked, and"}, {"start": 439.0, "text": "we can really see it when we"}, {"start": 441.0, "text": "introduce this centered circle"}, {"start": 443.0, "text": "around that Play glyph."}, {"start": 445.0, "text": "Notice, that art is perfectly"}, {"start": 447.0, "text": "centered within that space, but"}, {"start": 450.0, "text": "optically, it just, it just"}, {"start": 451.0, "text": "looks off."}, {"start": 452.0, "text": "So, if we nudge that over a few"}, {"start": 454.0, "text": "pixels to the right, we achieve"}, {"start": 457.0, "text": "a much more balanced result."}, {"start": 460.0, "text": "So, here's the before and the"}, {"start": 463.0, "text": "after."}, {"start": 465.0, "text": "And optical positioning can"}, {"start": 467.0, "text": "apply to almost any asset that's"}, {"start": 469.0, "text": "asymmetrical or heavier on one"}, {"start": 471.0, "text": "side than the other."}, {"start": 472.0, "text": "In this example, the share glyph"}, {"start": 476.0, "text": "is, again, perfectly centered"}, {"start": 477.0, "text": "within that space, but it just"}, {"start": 479.0, "text": "looks like it's sitting a bit"}, {"start": 481.0, "text": "too low."}, {"start": 483.0, "text": "So, by nudging it up a few"}, {"start": 484.0, "text": "pixels, we achieve, again, a"}, {"start": 486.0, "text": "much more considered result."}, {"start": 490.0, "text": "And by the way, you can bake"}, {"start": 491.0, "text": "this padding right into the"}, {"start": 492.0, "text": "asset."}, {"start": 494.0, "text": "So, when you go to integrate,"}, {"start": 496.0, "text": "you just center that asset"}, {"start": 497.0, "text": "perfectly in that space, and any"}, {"start": 500.0, "text": "adjustments that are needed be"}, {"start": 502.0, "text": "done with a simple"}, {"start": 503.0, "text": "as well."}, {"start": 506.0, "text": "So, when you're crafting your"}, {"start": 507.0, "text": "glyphs, build them as sets."}, {"start": 513.0, "text": "Test them in context, and always"}, {"start": 515.0, "text": "preview them on device, and this"}, {"start": 516.0, "text": "will help you achieve these"}, {"start": 517.0, "text": "results."}, {"start": 524.0, "text": "So, when you're creating"}, {"start": 525.0, "text": "something from scratch, it can"}, {"start": 526.0, "text": "often be hard to find a starting"}, {"start": 527.0, "text": "point. It could be overwhelming."}, {"start": 529.0, "text": "So, how do you get started?"}, {"start": 532.0, "text": "Let's look at a couple of"}, {"start": 533.0, "text": "considerations that can help."}, {"start": 535.0, "text": "When designing for spaces inside"}, {"start": 537.0, "text": "of your app, you know, such as"}, {"start": 539.0, "text": "list views or buttons, consider"}, {"start": 541.0, "text": "the relationship between type"}, {"start": 542.0, "text": "and the glyphs."}, {"start": 545.0, "text": "If you have a light type style,"}, {"start": 547.0, "text": "consider matching your lines to"}, {"start": 548.0, "text": "the weight of the type."}, {"start": 550.0, "text": "If you have a heavy type style,"}, {"start": 551.0, "text": "or more weighted, or filled"}, {"start": 553.0, "text": "glyph style, it might be more"}, {"start": 554.0, "text": "appropriate."}, {"start": 557.0, "text": "Here's an example from Airbnb."}, {"start": 559.0, "text": "Notice the lines of the glyphs"}, {"start": 561.0, "text": "match the fonts nicely."}, {"start": 563.0, "text": "Looks like they really"}, {"start": 564.0, "text": "considered that relationship"}, {"start": 565.0, "text": "between type and glyphs, and it"}, {"start": 566.0, "text": "looks nice."}, {"start": 571.0, "text": "Now, for system spaces, such as"}, {"start": 574.0, "text": "the Touch Bar on the Mac or Home"}, {"start": 576.0, "text": "screen quick action menus on"}, {"start": 579.0, "text": "iOS, and the central resource"}, {"start": 581.0, "text": "can be the existing system"}, {"start": 583.0, "text": "assets."}, {"start": 586.0, "text": "In Airbnb's Home screen quick"}, {"start": 588.0, "text": "action menu, we can see the"}, {"start": 589.0, "text": "consistency between their custom"}, {"start": 591.0, "text": "glyphs and the platforms shared"}, {"start": 593.0, "text": "glyphs."}, {"start": 596.0, "text": "And notice, these glyphs are a"}, {"start": 597.0, "text": "bit larger and heavier than"}, {"start": 599.0, "text": "their in-app counterparts."}, {"start": 602.0, "text": "So, this is an excellent example"}, {"start": 603.0, "text": "of craftsmanship here by Airbnb."}, {"start": 607.0, "text": "Now, we have templates on the"}, {"start": 610.0, "text": "human interface guidelines to"}, {"start": 611.0, "text": "help you match optical weight"}, {"start": 614.0, "text": "lines and positioning."}, {"start": 616.0, "text": "This will help you save time, be"}, {"start": 619.0, "text": "harmonious with the established"}, {"start": 620.0, "text": "design language, and you can"}, {"start": 622.0, "text": "even output your assets directly"}, {"start": 623.0, "text": "from these templates, which is"}, {"start": 624.0, "text": "really nice."}, {"start": 628.0, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 629.0, "text": "So, we've gone over a bunch of"}, {"start": 630.0, "text": "things here in a short period of"}, {"start": 632.0, "text": "time. Let's do a quick recap."}, {"start": 634.0, "text": "When conceptualizing a glyph,"}, {"start": 636.0, "text": "simplify and think globally."}, {"start": 640.0, "text": "When crafting them, build them"}, {"start": 643.0, "text": "as sets and test them in context"}, {"start": 645.0, "text": "to make them feel like a family."}, {"start": 649.0, "text": "Consider the relationship of"}, {"start": 652.0, "text": "type in your glyphs."}, {"start": 656.0, "text": "And finally, adapt your assets"}, {"start": 659.0, "text": "for system spaces."}, {"start": 661.0, "text": "So, I hope that these tips will"}, {"start": 663.0, "text": "help you build more effective"}, {"start": 664.0, "text": "and delightful experiences."}, {"start": 667.0, "text": "But wait a minute, something"}, {"start": 668.0, "text": "looks wrong here."}, {"start": 670.0, "text": "That's much better."}]}